  CLAIMED --> CLAIMED: delegate (processes:task:manage)
  OPEN --> CLAIMED: reassign to a user (processes:task:manage)
  CLAIMED --> COMPLETED: complete, form valid, four-eyes passes
  OPEN --> CANCELLED: instance cancelled or migrated off the step
  CLAIMED --> CANCELLED: instance cancelled or migrated off the step
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
